Super Secret Move!

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:23.620
<b>Super Secret Move!!
"Thousand-Year Ten-Thousand-Year You Killer"</b>

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.700
Thousand-Year Ten-Thousand-Year You Killer!

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:26.050
Stab! Stab! Stab!

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.680
Stab! Stab! Stab!

