00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.380
Only Min-chan can call me Daddy!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.300
That makes me want to 
call you that even more.

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.990
Daddydaddydaddydaddydaddy!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:09.260
Daddydaddydaddydaddy!

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:11.430
Shaddup!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.600
