00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.300
Shit! Shit! Shit! Shit! Shit!

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:40.600
Stop it, you female glober!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.830
That guy is my prey!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.450
Shut up and piss off!

00:06:43.450 --> 00:06:45.000
<i>When I was a kid,</i>

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.800
<i>my Mother beat me that way, too.</i>

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.740
<i>Every single move of hers brings back</i>

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:52.650
<i>memories of my childhood.</i>

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:56.280
<i>Back then, I physically felt the</i>

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.060
