me right in the heart.</i>

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:09.800
<i>It hurts. It really hurts.</i>

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.480
<i>It hurts so much, it's so hard to take,</i>

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.270
<i>and it's irresistible.</i>

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.850
<i>This planet has a woman 
as beautiful as Mother.</i>

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.920
<i>I want to marry her!</i>

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:23.680
<i>I don't mind offering every 
last bit of my heart to her!</i>

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.130
It's... It's my fault.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:38.260
Lady glober.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.540
Ignore him.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:44.120
