00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.860
My, you're young and a hunk.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.840
Come in, come in.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.070
Fatty, you come here, too.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.080
Huh? There's someone else living here?

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.910
That's right. It's a long story.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.530
